WEBVTT

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:31.930
but their history certainly was.

00:01:31.963 --> 00:01:33.963
And this is pretty much my stance on it.

00:01:33.963 --> 00:01:37.297
It doesn't matter
whether or not a ghost is real.

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.530
The ghost story is,

00:01:39.563 --> 00:01:43.463
and the fact that we maybe, kind of,
sort of believe a ghost might be real

00:01:43.463 --> 00:01:46.863
is significant, and we should
pay attention to it.

00:01:47.897 --> 00:01:50.363
I'm not the only one
who thinks this, by the way.

00:01:50.363 --> 00:01:53.630
There is a whole field
of interdisciplinary research

00:01:53.663 --> 00:01:55.663
called “spectrality studies,”

00:01:55.697 --> 00:01:58.597
which is proof that academics
will think of anything.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.430
Still, this idea
was transformative for me,